                                "example_id": "d7fba2dc-73b7-44fb-abe1-9aeffb9719fd",
                                "sense_id": "35ff587a-06a6-3eaf-b824-d9564b5637d6",
                                "text": "The town awakes; the great tee-totum is set up for its daily spin and whirl; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8d536e38-586a-4722-bc22-eed395eb8a2a",
                                "sense_id": "35ff587a-06a6-3eaf-b824-d9564b5637d6",
                                "text": "\"Are you a child or a teetotum?\" the Sheep said, as she took up another pair of needles. \"You'll make me giddy soon, if you go on turning round like that.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac7e7b97-3f13-4b53-95bb-7c6de1686691",
                                "sense_id": "35ff587a-06a6-3eaf-b824-d9564b5637d6",
                                "text": "Ho! ho! ho! ho! ho! ho! ho/Time's teetotum/If you spin it/Gives it quotum..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
